# The build context of the Dockerfile, as an allowlist: the package, the dbt projects, the lock file
# and what the build reads. Everything else stays out, first of all .env, keys, Terraform states and
# the local Dagster, dlt, DuckDB and dbt state.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!.python-version
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSES
!NOTICE
!src
!dlt_pipelines
!dbt
!.dlt/config.toml
!scripts/dbt_all.py

# ...minus the local state inside those
**/__pycache__
**/.local_defs_state
dbt/*/target
dbt/*/packages
dbt/*/dbt_packages
dbt/*/logs
dbt/.user.yml
